                                                "sense_id": "d52d6d14-30a9-3079-80d8-5e4c756170b4",
                                                "text": "Some companies, like Citizen Agency, a San Francisco Internet consulting firm that has done the most to evangelize coworking, have an open-door policy, in which people rent desks but others are free to drop in and use the Wi-Fi or the conference room."
